===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|grammar}} A sentence that has two or more [[independent clause]]s, joined by a [[conjunction]] (such as 'but', 'and') and/or [[punctuation]] (such as ',').
{{examples|examples=The alarm went off and I got out of bed.<br>I got to work but my computer wouldn't work}}

